<h1>Stray Thoughts Admin Side</h1>

<p>This 'Admin Side' of this Stray Thoughts project contains things that I thought would make controlling and monitoring whats happening on the back side of the project easier</p>

<p>This entire project is basically my attempt to do a practical exercise to apply AI driven development using C# Asp.Net as framework and Github Copilot (cuz its free) for the LLM.</p>

<p>And since this is the case, I made this back side version open to public viewing.</p>